        <body>
            <div xml:id="d599">

                <pb facs="0589" n="423" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg423"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 337.11/388</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-31T00:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 31, 1917, midnight</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 30, 5 p.m. Government promises regular cavalry sufficient for
                    protection will reach Nipe Bay Sunday night.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
